MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add the argument all.x=TRUE which will keep all rows from x (aka a in
this case)

merge(a, b, by.x= c("x", "y"), by.y= c("x", "y"), all.x=TRUE)

Thanks,
Alex Mandel, PhD

