Perhaps try the as.is <http://as.is>=TRUE flag? Seems to work for me if you include that (and exclude the na.strings flag):

r <- read.csv("~/Downloads/data.csv", stringsAsFactors=FALSE, encoding="UTF8", as.is <http://as.is> = T)

adios,
Ryan

